m (5/8”), 19 mm (3/4”)Pression supportée3 à 30 bars (selon qualité)Température de service-10°C à +60°CMatériauxPVC, caoutchouc, polyester renforcéCouche(s) de renforcement1 à 5 couches (anti-torsion, anti-écrasement)NormesCE, RoHS, REACHCompatibilitéRaccords standards (1/2\", 3/4\"), systèmes d’arrosage"}$j$::jsonb, 'https://lechantier.ma/en/produits/tuyau/tuyaux-d-arrosage') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, description = EXCLUDED.description, category = EXCLUDED.category, brand = EXCLUDED.brand, sku = EXCLUDED.sku, price = EXCLUDED.price, currency = EXCLUDED.currency, unit = EXCLUDED.unit, min_quantity = EXCLUDED.min_quantity, cover = EXCLUDED.cover, gallery = EXCLUDED.gallery, delivery_cities = EXCLUDED.delivery_cities, attributes = EXCLUDED.attributes, source_url = EXCLUDED.source_url, user_id = EXCLUDED.user_id, updated_at = NOW();
